BT /F2 11 Tf 64 695 Td (1. Premises and Term) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 679 Td (The Landlord leases to the Tenant the apartment at Fjärdingsvägen 22, apartment 1204, 123) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 664 Td (46 Solvik \(the "Premises"\). The lease runs for a fixed term of 24 months from 2026-12-01. It) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 649 Td (renews automatically for further periods of 24 months unless the Tenant gives written notice of) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 634 Td (non-renewal at least 6 months before the end of the current period. The Landlord is not required) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 619 Td (to give any notice of non-renewal.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 64 596 Td (2. Rent and Payment) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 580 Td (The Tenant shall pay rent of 12 500 SEK per month in advance, no later than the 25th day of) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 565 Td (the preceding month, to IBAN SE35 5000 0000 0549 1000 0003. If any payment is late, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 550 Td (Tenant shall pay a late fee of 5% of the monthly rent for each day of delay, in addition to) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 535 Td (statutory interest.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 64 512 Td (3. Rent Increases) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 496 Td (The Landlord may increase the rent at any time, by any amount, by giving the Tenant 14 days) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 481 Td (written notice. The Tenant has no right to object to a rent increase.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 64 458 Td (4. Security Deposit) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 442 Td (On signing, the Tenant shall pay a security deposit of 37 500 SEK. The deposit does not bear) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 427 Td (interest. The Landlord shall return the deposit within 120 days after the lease ends, less any) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 412 Td (deductions that the Landlord decides, in its sole discretion, are justified.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 64 389 Td (5. Use of the Premises) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 373 Td (The Premises may be used only as a private residence for the Tenant. Pets are not permitted.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 358 Td (The Tenant may not sublet or lend the Premises, or any part of it, under any circumstances.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 343 Td (The Landlord may enter the Premises at any time and without notice.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 64 320 Td (6. Maintenance and Repairs) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 304 Td (The Tenant is responsible for the cost of all maintenance and repairs of the Premises and its) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 289 Td (fixtures, including appliances, plumbing, heating and structural defects, regardless of their) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 274 Td (cause.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 64 251 Td (7. Termination) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 235 Td (The Landlord may terminate this Agreement at any time, for any reason, by giving the Tenant) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 220 Td (30 days written notice. The Tenant may terminate this Agreement only at the end of the fixed) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 205 Td (term or a renewal period, by giving 6 months written notice. If the Tenant leaves earlier, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 190 Td (Tenant shall pay an early termination fee equal to 6 months rent.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 64 167 Td (8. Liability) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 151 Td (The Tenant is liable without limit for all damage to the Premises, including normal wear and) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 64 136 Td (tear. The Landlord is not liable for any loss of or damage to the Tenant's belongings, or for any) Tj ET
